{% if report.settlement.reclaimed %}<section class="panel exceptions"><h3>补扫认回</h3><p>这些回执原批次已认定归属，补扫只把到达分钟提前，仍在同一笔停靠的覆盖区间内。</p><div class="tablebox"><table><thead><tr><th>回执</th><th>原行</th><th>金额</th><th>原停靠</th><th>补扫后停靠</th><th>到达</th><th>归属依据</th></tr></thead><tbody>{% for row in report.settlement.reclaimed %}<tr><td>{{ row.receipt }}</td><td>{{ row.line }}</td><td>{{ yuan(row.cents) }}</td><td><code>{{ row.parent_stay[:12] }}</code> · {{ local(row.parent_arrival) }}</td><td><code>{{ row.new_stay[:12] }}</code> · {{ local(row.new_arrival) }}–{{ local(row.new_end)[-5:] }}</td><td>{{ local(row.receipt_arrival) }}</td><td>{{ label[row.basis] }}（检测 {{ row.detections|join(', ') }}）</td></tr>{% endfor %}</tbody></table></div></section>{% endif %}
<section class="panel exceptions"><h3>{{ '仍有争议的款' if report.settlement.parent else '游离实收' }}</h3>{% if report.settlement.parent %}<p>无法满足原批次归属或停靠连续性的回执不并入任何逐单，留待人工复核。</p>{% endif %}{% for row in report.settlement.orphans %}<p>回执 {{ row.fields.receipt }} · 第 {{ row.line }} 行 · {{ yuan(row.cents) }}{% if row.reason is defined and row.reason %} · {{ label.get(row.reason,'待复核') }}{% endif %}{% if row.parent_stay is defined and row.parent_stay %} · 原停靠 <code>{{ row.parent_stay[:12] }}</code>{% endif %}</p>{% else %}<p>无游离回执。</p>{% endfor %}</section>
